t Here						\n									<p>\n						Teach what you love. Masterstudy gives you the tools to create a course.					</p>\n												<a href=\"/starter-theme/user-account\">\n									Start Teaching\n					</a>',	'Home',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'home-2',	'',	'',	'2026-08-24 14:16:53',	'2026-08-24 14:16:53',	'',	0,	'http://masterstudy.stylemixthemes.com/lms-plugin//home-2/',	0,	'page',	'',	0),
