(53778,	1,	'2026-08-24 11:54:46',	'2026-08-24 11:54:46',	'<h2>Learn Quran Online\nWith Qualified Tutors</h2>		<p>Personalized one-to-one Quran classes for kids and adults. Learn Quran Reading, Tajweed, Hifz, Noorani Qaida and Islamic studies from comfort of your home.</p>								<a href=\"http://masterstudy.http://stylemixthemes.com/lms-plugin/courses-page/\">\n									Book your Free Class\n					</a>\n									<h2>Start Learning Quran Online</h2>					<strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"76\">Learn Al Quran Organization</strong> has helped students and families worldwide learn the Quran online. We offer <strong data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"194\">personalized one-to-one Quran classes</strong> for kids, adults, and beginners with qualified male and female teachers. Whether you are a complete beginner, a parent looking for Quran classes for your child, or an adult who wants to improve Quran recitation, Learn Al Quran Organization provides personalized online Quran learning for students worldwide. 					<h2>Learn Quran in 3 Easy Steps</h2>					Start your Quran learning journey with Learn Al Quran Organization. Register yourself or your child today and experience personalized, one-to-one Quran classes with qualified male and female tutors.							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M624 208h-64v-64c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v64h-64c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v32c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h64v64c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-64h64c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-32c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16zm-400 48c70.7 0 128-57.3 128-128S294.7 0 224 0 96 57.3 96 128s57.3 128 128 128zm89.6 32h-16.7c-22.2 10.2-46.9 16-72.9 16s-50.6-5.8-72.9-16h-16.7C60.2 288 0 348.2 0 422.4V464c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48v-41.6c0-74.2-60.2-134.4-134.4-134.4z\"></path></svg>				\n							1. Register Online						\n									<p>\n						Complete our quick registration form and share your learning goals and preferred schedule.					</p>\