es</h2>		<p>Give your child a strong foundation in Quran reading with our beginner-friendly online Quran classes. Our interactive one-to-one classes are designed to keep children engaged while helping them develop correct pronunciation and confidence.</p>								<a href=\"/starter-theme/courses-page/\">\n									View All Courses\n					</a>\n									<h2>Why Choose Learn Al Quran Organization\n</h2>					At Learn Al Quran Organization, we make Quran learning accessible, flexible, and engaging for children and adults around the world. Our one-to-one online Quran classes are designed to provide personalized attention and help students develop accurate Quran reading, Tajweed, memorization, and Islamic knowledge in a supportive learning environment.\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"102.411\" height=\"102.434\" viewBox=\"0 0 102.411 102.434\"><path id=\"Shape_1\" data-name=\"Shape 1\" d=\"M417.682,3682.968l-10.6-17.681v16.364a2.56,2.56,0,1,1-5.12,0v-16.364l-10.606,17.678a2.559,2.559,0,0,1-2.2,1.245,2.515,2.515,0,0,1-1.316-.364,2.557,2.557,0,0,1-.881-3.512L400,3658.6H378.914a5.121,5.121,0,0,1-5.12-5.122v-40.967a5.12,5.12,0,0,1,5.12-5.121H430.12a5.12,5.12,0,0,1,5.12,5.121v3.912l-5.12,2.56v-6.472H378.914v40.971H430.12V3647.4l5.12-1.279v7.367a5.12,5.12,0,0,1-5.12,5.121H409.037l13.037,21.732a2.554,2.554,0,0,1-.88,3.511,2.5,2.5,0,0,1-1.311.37A2.565,2.565,0,0,1,417.682,3682.968Zm32.92,1.245a5.121,5.121,0,0,1-5.09-4.556l-4.474-40.266-14.8,3.7a5.121,5.121,0,0,1-6.362-4.969V3634.2l-31.428-8.982a2.559,2.559,0,0,1,1.41-4.919l31.6,9.029a5.134,5.134,0,0,1,1.253-.906l20.482-10.243a5.129,5.129,0,0,1,2.29-.541h20.482a5.122,5.122,0,0,1,5.038,4.2l5.121,28.167a5.121,5.121,0,0,1-5.039,6.038h-3.272l-1.866,23.452a5.12,5.12,0,0,1-5.1,4.716Zm0-5.12h10.241l2.24-28.168h8l-5.12-28.168h-7.682v15.581a2.56,2.56,0,1,1-5.12,0v-15.581h-7.681L425,3633v5.122L445.481,3633Zm-10.241-81.943a15.362,15.362,0,1,1,15.362,15.364A15.38,15.38,0,0,1,440.36,3597.149Zm5.121,0a10.241,10.241,0,1,0,10.