rganization, we make Quran learning accessible, flexible, and engaging for children and adults around the world. Our one-to-one online Quran classes are designed to provide personalized attention and help students develop accurate Quran reading, Tajweed, memorization, and Islamic knowledge in a supportive learning environment.\n					<h2>Become a Quran Tutor</h2>					Are you a qualified Quran teacher looking to teach students online? Join Learn Al Quran Organization and connect with students from around the world.							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M624 208h-64v-64c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v64h-64c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v32c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h64v64c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-64h64c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-32c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16zm-400 48c70.7 0 128-57.3 128-128S294.7 0 224 0 96 57.3 96 128s57.3 128 128 128zm89.6 32h-16.7c-22.2 10.2-46.9 16-72.9 16s-50.6-5.8-72.9-16h-16.7C60.2 288 0 348.2 0 422.4V464c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48v-41.6c0-74.2-60.2-134.4-134.4-134.4z\"></path></svg>				\n							1. Create Your Tutor Profile						\n									<p>\n						Build your professional tutor profile and highlight the Quran courses you teach					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M622.34 153.2L343.4 67.5c-15.2-4.67-31.6-4.67-46.79 0L17.66 153.2c-23.54 7.23-23.54 38.36 0 45.59l48.63 14.94c-10.67 13.19-17.23 29.28-17.88 46.9C38.78 266.15 32 276.11 32 288c0 10.78 5.68 19.85 13.86 25.65L20.33 428.53C18.11 438.52 25.71 448 35.94 448h56.11c10.24 0 17.84-9.48 15.62-19.47L82.14 313.65C90.32 307.85 96 298.78 96 288c0-11.57-6.47-21.25-15.66-26.87.76-15.02 8.44-28.3 20.69-36.72L296.6 284.5c9.06 2.78 26.44 6.25 46.79 0l278.95-85.7c23.55-7.24 23.55-38.36 0-45.6zM352.79 315.09c-28.53 8.76-52.84 3.92-65.59 0l-145.02-44.55L128 384c0 35.35 85.96 64 192 64s192-28.65 192-64l-14.18-113.47-145.03 44.56z\"></path></svg>				\