(53787,	1,	'2026-08-24 12:51:45',	'2026-08-24 12:51:45',	'<h2>Start Learning Quran Online​</h2>		<p>Personalized one-to-one Quran classes for kids and adults. Learn Quran Reading, Tajweed, Hifz, Noorani Qaida and Islamic studies from comfort of your home.</p>								<a href=\"http://masterstudy.http://stylemixthemes.com/lms-plugin/courses-page/\">\n									Book your Free Class\n					</a>\n									<h2>Learn Al-Quran Courses</h2>				\n				<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n					<img src=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-05-11-113037.png\">				</a>\n				Free\n		0.0\n						<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/?terms%5B%5D=23&#038;category%5B%5D=23\">\n							Tajweed						</a>\n									<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n						<h3>Tajweed</h3>\n					</a>\n3\n	1 Lecture\nAdvanced\n							<img src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6caefbd9fef726ec923fa93f4ffdd80eb0b4f828f44b0030420fba0e4e80f14c?s=215&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\">\n								hassaniqbal\n		<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n		<h3>Tajweed</h3>\n	</a>\nAdvanced\n	1 Lecture\n0 Hours\n		<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n			Preview this course\n					</a>\n			Add to Wishlist\n		Members Only\n					<h2>Learn Quran in 3 Easy Steps</h2>					Start your Quran learning journey with Learn Al Quran Organization. Register yourself or your child today and experience personalized, one-to-one Quran classes with qualified male and female tutors.							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M624 208h-64v-64c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v64h-64c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v32c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h64v64c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-64h64c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-32c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16zm-400 48c70.7 0 128-57.3 128-128S294.7 0 224 0 96 57.3 96 128s57.3 128 128 128zm89.6 32h-16.7c-22.2 10.2-46