(53797,	1,	'2026-08-24 13:10:08',	'2026-08-24 13:10:08',	'<h2>Start Learning Quran Online​</h2>		<p>Personalized one-to-one Quran classes for kids and adults. Learn Quran Reading, Tajweed, Hifz, Noorani Qaida and Islamic studies from comfort of your home.</p>								<a href=\"http://masterstudy.http://stylemixthemes.com/lms-plugin/courses-page/\">\n									Book your Free Class\n					</a>\n									<h2>Our Popular Courses</h2>				\n				<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n					<img src=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-05-11-113037.png\">				</a>\n				Free\n		0.0\n						<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/?terms%5B%5D=23&#038;category%5B%5D=23\">\n							Tajweed						</a>\n									<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n						<h3>Tajweed</h3>\n					</a>\n3\n	1 Lecture\nAdvanced\n							<img src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6caefbd9fef726ec923fa93f4ffdd80eb0b4f828f44b0030420fba0e4e80f14c?s=215&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\">\n								hassaniqbal\n		<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n		<h3>Tajweed</h3>\n	</a>\nAdvanced\n	1 Lecture\n0 Hours\n		<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n			Preview this course\n					</a>\n			Add to Wishlist\n		Members Only\n															<img width=\"950\" height=\"725\" src=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Image_29-1-1.png\" alt=\"theme_placeholder\" srcset=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Image_29-1-1.png 950w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Image_29-1-1-300x229.png 300w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Image_29-1-1-768x586.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" />																<h2>Learn Quran in 3 Easy Steps</h2>					Start your Quran learning journey with Learn Al Quran Organization. Register yourself or your child today and experience personalized, one-to-one Quran classes with qualified male and female tutors.							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M624 208h-64v-64c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v64h-64c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v32c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h64v64c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-64h64c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-32c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16zm-400 48c70.7 0 128-57.3 128-128S294.7 0 224 0 96 57.3 96 128s57.3 128 128 128zm89.6 32h-16.7c-22.2 10.2-46.9 16-72.9 16s-50.6-5.8-72.9-16h-16.7C60.2 288 0 348.2 0 422.4V464c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48v-41.6c0-74.2-60.2-134.4-134.4-134.4z\"></path></svg>				\n							1. Register Online						\n									<p>\n						Complete our quick registration form and share your learning goals and preferred schedule.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M32 448c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h160V320H32v128zm256 32h160c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32V320H288v160zm192-320h-42.1c6.2-12.1 10.1-25.5 10.1-40 0-48.5-39.5-88-88-88-41.6 0-68.5 21.3-103 68.3-34.5-47-61.4-68.3-103-68.3-48.5 0-88 39.5-88 88 0 14.5 3.8 27.9 10.1 40H32c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32v80c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h480c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-80c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32zm-326.1 0c-22.1 0-40-17.9-40-40s17.9-40 40-40c19.9 0 34.6 3.3 86.1 80h-86.1zm206.1 0h-86.1c51.4-76.5 65.7-80 86.1-80 22.1 0 40 17.9 40 40s-17.9 40-40 40z\"></path></svg>				\n							2. Book Your Free Trial						\n									<p>\n						Enjoy a 3-day free trial and experience our personalized teaching approach.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M542.22 32.05c-54.8 3.11-163.72 14.43-230.96 55.59-4.64 2.84-7.27 7.89-7.27 13.17v363.87c0 11.55 12.63 18.85 23.28 13.49 69.18-34.82 169.23-44.32 218.7-46.92 16.89-.89 30.02-14.43 30.02-30.66V62.75c.01-17.71-15.35-31.74-33.77-30.7zM264.73 87.64C197.5 46.48 88.58 35.17 33.78 32.05 15.36 31.01 0 45.04 0 62.75V400.6c0 16.24 13.13 29.78 30.