(53800,	1,	'2026-08-24 13:11:10',	'2026-08-24 13:11:10',	'<h2>Learn the Quran. Live the Quran.</h2>		<p>Learn the Quran online with qualified teachers from the comfort of your home. Build a strong connection with the Quran through personalized, flexible, and engaging lessons for children and adults worldwide.</p>								<a href=\"http://masterstudy.http://stylemixthemes.com/lms-plugin/courses-page/\">\n									START LEARNING\n					</a>\n									<h2>Choose Your Path to Quranic Learning</h2>					Whether you are starting from the very beginning or looking to improve your recitation, we have a learning path for you. Explore Quran courses designed for children, adults, beginners, and advanced learners. Learn at your own pace and grow your connection with the Quran.				\n				<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n					<img src=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-05-11-113037.png\">				</a>\n				Free\n		0.0\n						<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/?terms%5B%5D=23&#038;category%5B%5D=23\">\n							Tajweed						</a>\n									<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n						<h3>Tajweed</h3>\n					</a>\n3\n	1 Lecture\nAdvanced\n							<img src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6caefbd9fef726ec923fa93f4ffdd80eb0b4f828f44b0030420fba0e4e80f14c?s=215&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\">\n								hassaniqbal\n		<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n		<h3>Tajweed</h3>\n	</a>\nAdvanced\n	1 Lecture\n0 Hours\n		<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n			Preview this course\n					</a>\n			Add to Wishlist\n		Members Only\n										<a href=\"http://masterstudy.http://stylemixthemes.com/lms-plugin/courses-page/\">\n									View All Courses\n					</a>\n									<h2>Why Choose Learn Al Quran Organization\n</h2>					At Learn Al Quran Organization, we make Quran learning accessible, flexible, and engaging for children and adults around the world. Our one-to-one online Quran classes are designed to provide personalized attention and help students develop accurate Quran reading, Tajweed, memorization, and Islamic knowledge in a supportive learning environment.				\n		<h2>\n			Learn from Qualified Teachers		</h2>\n			Learn from experienced and qualified Quran teachers who are committed to helping you improve your recitation, understanding, and knowledge of the Quran.		\n		<a href=\"\"\n					>\n					</a>\n		<h2>\n			Learn at Your Own Pace		</h2>\n			Learn from experienced and qualified Quran teachers who are committed to helping you improve your recitation, understanding, and knowledge of the Quran.		\n		<a href=\"\"\n					>\n					</a>\n		<h2>\n			Learning for Every Age		</h2>\n			Learn from experienced and qualified Quran teachers who are committed to helping you improve your recitation, understanding, and knowledge of the Quran.		\n		<a href=\"\"\n					>\n					</a>\n															<img width=\"950\" height=\"725\" src=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Image_29-1-1.png\" alt=\"theme_placeholder\" srcset=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Image_29-1-1.png 950w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Image_29-1-1-300x229.png 300w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Image_29-1-1-768x586.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" />																<h2>Learn Quran in 3 Easy Steps</h2>					Start your Quran learning journey with Learn Al Quran Organization. Register yourself or your child today and experience personalized, one-to-one Quran classes with qualified male and female tutors.							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M624 208h-64v-64c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v64h-64c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v32c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h64v64c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-64h64c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-32c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16zm-400 48c70.7 0 128-57.3 128-12