(53828,	1,	'2026-08-24 14:16:53',	'2026-08-24 14:16:53',	'<h2>Learn the Quran. Live the Quran.</h2>		<p>Learn the Quran online with qualified teachers from the comfort of your home. Build a strong connection with the Quran through personalized, flexible, and engaging lessons for children and adults worldwide.</p>								<a href=\"http://masterstudy.http://stylemixthemes.com/lms-plugin/courses-page/\">\n									START LEARNING\n					</a>\n									<h2>Choose Your Path to Quranic Learning</h2>					Whether you are starting from the very beginning or looking to improve your recitation, we have a learning path for you. Explore Quran courses designed for children, adults, beginners, and advanced learners. Learn at your own pace and grow your connection with the Quran.				\n				<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n					<img src=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-05-11-113037.png\">				</a>\n				Free\n		0.0\n						<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/?terms%5B%5D=23&#038;category%5B%5D=23\">\n							Tajweed						</a>\n									<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n						<h3>Tajweed</h3>\n					</a>\n3\n	1 Lecture\nAdvanced\n							<img src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6caefbd9fef726ec923fa93f4ffdd80eb0b4f828f44b0030420fba0e4e80f14c?s=215&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g\">\n								hassaniqbal\n		<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n		<h3>Tajweed</h3>\n	</a>\nAdvanced\n	1 Lecture\n0 Hours\n		<a href=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/courses-page/tajweed/\">\n			Preview this course\n					</a>\n			Add to Wishlist\n		Members Only\n										<a href=\"http://masterstudy.http://stylemixthemes.com/lms-plugin/courses-page/\">\n									View All Courses\n					</a>\n									<h2>Why Choose Learn AL-Quran Organization\n</h2>					At Learn AL-Quran Organization, we make Quran learning accessible, flexible, and engaging for children and adults around the world. Our one-to-one online Quran classes are designed to provide personalized attention and help students develop accurate Quran reading, Tajweed, memorization, and Islamic knowledge in a supportive learning environment.				\n		<h2>\n			Learn from Qualified Teachers		</h2>\n			Learn from experienced and qualified Quran teachers who are committed to helping you improve your recitation, understanding, and knowledge of the Quran.		\n		<a href=\"\"\n					>\n					</a>\n		<h2>\n			Learn at Your Own Pace		</h2>\n			Busy schedule? No problem. Choose convenient class timings and learn from the comfort of your home, wherever you are in the world, at your own preferred pace.		\n		<a href=\"\"\n					>\n					</a>\n		<h2>\n			Learning for Every Age		</h2>\n			From young children taking their first steps with Noorani Qaida to adults improving Tajweed and Quran recitation, our courses are designed for every stage of learning.		\n		<a href=\"\"\n					>\n					</a>\n															<img width=\"1436\" height=\"1096\" src=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Learn-online.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Learn-online.jpg 1436w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Learn-online-300x229.jpg 300w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Learn-online-1024x782.jpg 1024w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Learn-online-768x586.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1436px) 100vw, 1436px\" />																<h2>Learn Quran in 3 Easy Steps</h2>							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M624 208h-64v-64c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v64h-64c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v32c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h64v64c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-64h64c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-32c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16zm-400 48c70.7 0 128-57.3 128-128S294.7 0 224 0 96 57.3 96 128s57.3 128 128 128zm89.6 32h-16.7c-22.2 10.2-46.9 16-72.9 16s-50.6-5.8-72.9-16h-16.7C60.2 288 0 348.2 0 422.4V464c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48v-41.6c0-74.2-60.2-134.4-134.4-134.4z\"></path></svg>				\n							1. Register Online						\n									<p>\n						Complete our quick registration form and share your learning goals and preferred schedule.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M32 448c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h160V320H32v128zm256 32h160c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32V320H288v160zm192-320h-42.1c6.2-12.1 10.1-25.5 10.1-40 0-48.5-39.5-88-88-88-41.6 0-68.5 21.3-103 68.3-34.5-47-61.4-68.3-103-68.3-48.5 0-88 39.5-88 88 0 14.5 3.8 27.9 10.1 40H32c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32v80c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h480c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-80c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32zm-326.1 0c-22.1 0-40-17.9-40-40s17.9-40 40-40c19.9 0 34.6 3.3 86.1 80h-86.1zm206.1 0h-86.1c51.4-76.5 65.7-80 86.1-80 22.1 0 40 17.9 40 40s-17.9 40-40 40z\"></path></svg>				\n							2. Book Your Free Trial						\n									<p>\n						Enjoy a 3-day free trial and experience our personalized teaching approach.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M542.22 32.05c-54.8 3.11-163.72 14.43-230.96 55.59-4.64 2.84-7.27 7.89-7.27 13.17v363.87c0 11.55 12.63 18.85 23.28 13.49 69.18-34.82 169.23-44.32 218.7-46.92 16.89-.89 30.02-14.43 30.02-30.66V62.75c.01-17.71-15.35-31.74-33.77-30.7zM264.73 87.64C197.5 46.48 88.58 35.17 33.78 32.05 15.36 31.01 0 45.04 0 62.75V400.6c0 16.24 13.13 29.78 30.02 30.66 49.49 2.6 149.59 12.11 218.77 46.95 10.62 5.35 23.21-1.94 23.21-13.46V100.63c0-5.29-2.62-10.14-7.27-12.99z\"></path></svg>				\n							3. Start Learning Quran						\n									<p>\n						Begin one-to-one live Quran classes with a qualified tutor from the comfort of your home.					</p>\n							<h2>Become a Quran Tutor</h2>							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M624 208h-64v-64c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v64h-64c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v32c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h64v64c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-64h64c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-32c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16zm-400 48c70.7 0 128-57.3 128-128S294.7 0 224 0 96 57.3 96 128s57.3 128 128 128zm89.6 32h-16.7c-22.2 10.2-46.9 16-72.9 16s-50.6-5.8-72.9-16h-16.7C60.2 288 0 348.2 0 422.4V464c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48v-41.6c0-74.2-60.2-134.4-134.4-134.4z\"></path></svg>				\n							1. Create Your Tutor Profile						\n									<p>\n						Build your professional tutor profile and highlight the Quran courses you teach					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M622.34 153.2L343.4 67.5c-15.2-4.67-31.6-4.67-46.79 0L17.66 153.2c-23.54 7.23-23.54 38.36 0 45.59l48.63 14.94c-10.67 13.19-17.23 29.28-17.88 46.9C38.78 266.15 32 276.11 32 288c0 10.78 5.68 19.85 13.86 25.65L20.33 428.53C18.11 438.52 25.71 448 35.94 448h56.11c10.24 0 17.84-9.48 15.62-19.47L82.14 313.65C90.32 307.85 96 298.78 96 288c0-11.57-6.47-21.25-15.66-26.87.76-15.02 8.44-28.3 20.69-36.72L296.6 284.5c9.06 2.78 26.44 6.25 46.79 0l278.95-85.7c23.55-7.24 23.55-38.36 0-45.6zM352.79 315.09c-28.53 8.76-52.84 3.92-65.59 0l-145.02-44.55L128 384c0 35.35 85.96 64 192 64s192-28.65 192-64l-14.18-113.47-145.03 44.56z\"></path></svg>				\n							2. Connect With Students						\n									<p>\n						Once your profile is approved, students and parents can learn more about your teaching experience and contact with you about available classes.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M496 384H64V80c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16H16C7.16 64 0 71.16 0 80v336c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h464c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16v-32c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16zM464 96H345.94c-21.38 0-32.09 25.85-16.97 40.97l32.4 32.4L288 242.75l-73.37-73.37c-12.5-12.5-32.76-12.5-45.25 0l-68.69 68.69c-6.25 6.25-6.25 16.38 0 22.63l22.62 22.62c6.25 6.25 16.38 6.25 22.63 0L192 237.25l73.37 73.37c12.5 12.5 32.76 12.5 45.25 0l96-96 32.4 32.4c15.12 15.12 40.97 4.41 40.97-16.97V112c.01-8.84-7.15-16-15.99-16z\"></path></svg>				\n							3. Teach &amp; Grow						\n									<p>\n						Teach Quran online through flexible one-to-one classes and help students improve their Quran reading skills. 					</p>\n																	<img width=\"1456\" height=\"1088\" src=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/become-a-tutor.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/become-a-tutor.jpg 1456w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/become-a-tutor-300x225.jpg 300w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/become-a-tutor-1024x765.jpg 1024w, https://muslimkidstime.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/become-a-tutor-768x574.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1456px) 100vw, 1456px\" />																		\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"102.411\" height=\"102.434\" viewBox=\"0 0 102.411 102.434\"><path id=\"Shape_1\" data-name=\"Shape 1\" d=\"M417.682,3682.968l-10.6-17.681v16.364a2.56,2.56,0,1,1-5.12,0v-16.364l-10.606,17.678a2.559,2.559,0,0,1-2.2,1.245,2.515,2.515,0,0,1-1.316-.364,2.557,2.557,0,0,1-.881-3.512L400,3658.6H378.914a5.121,5.121,0,0,1-5.12-5.122v-40.967a5.12,5.12,0,0,1,5.12-5.121H430.12a5.12,5.12,0,0,1,5.12,5.121v3.912l-5.12,2.56v-6.472H378.914v40.971H430.12V3647.4l5.12-1.279v7.367a5.12,5.12,0,0,1-5.12,5.121H409.037l13.037,21.732a2.554,2.554,0,0,1-.88,3.511,2.5,2.5,0,0,1-1.311.37A2.565,2.565,0,0,1,417.682,3682.968Zm32.92,1.245a5.121,5.121,0,0,1-5.09-4.556l-4.474-40.266-14.8,3.7a5.121,5.121,0,0,1-6.362-4.969V3634.2l-31.428-8.982a2.559,2.559,0,0,1,1.41-4.919l31.6,9.029a5.134,5.134,0,0,1,1.253-.906l20.482-10.243a5.129,5.129,0,0,1,2.29-.541h20.482a5.122,5.122,0,0,1,5.038,4.2l5.121,28.167a5.121,5.121,0,0,1-5.039,6.038h-3.272l-1.866,23.452a5.12,5.12,0,0,1-5.1,4.716Zm0-5.12h10.241l2.24-28.168h8l-5.12-28.168h-7.682v15.581a2.56,2.56,0,1,1-5.12,0v-15.581h-7.681L425,3633v5.122L445.481,3633Zm-10.241-8