(250,	4,	'about_teacher',	'I am self-motivated, ambitious and eager to teach Arabic language. I have sufficient experience of 10 years in which I conducted workshops, committed classes, coordinated between Arabic department, edited Arabic books, made presentations, fulfilled given challenging tasks etc. I facilitate Arabic language learner by providing worksheets and by motivating them. I have strong communication skills and able to teach language learner a vivid language skills. Grammar would be defined and implemented in very easy ways.'),
