(343,	5,	'about_teacher',	'Assalaamu alaykum, I\'m Lukman, an Hafiz of the Qur\'an, I read Qur\'an with three different riwaayat (Hafs from Asim, Khalaf from Hamza, and Ad-Doury from abu amr), I speak both Arabic and English Language fluently, wal-hamdulillah. I have certificates on Nawh(Arabic grammar), Balagho, Usoulu-l-Fiqh, and Mustalahu-l-hadeeth books from International Science Academy. I also have Ijazaat from Sheikh Dr. Abdul-Muhsin Al-Qasim(Imam &amp; Khateeb Almasjid An-Nabawiy), Sheikh Dr Al-Mundhir As-Suhaybaaniy, Sheikh Dr. Khalid bn Mamoud Aljuhany, Sheikh Muhammad bn Ahmad Jammoul'),
